{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "号码被转走",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 131.58,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看账号这条路，SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "先看账号这条路，SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "攻击者让运营商，把受害者的手机号，转到自己的 SIM 卡上。",
   "spoken": "攻击者让运营商，把受害者的手机号，转到自己的 SIM 卡上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.372,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 5.47,
   "speechEnd": 9.803
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "常见的手法，是出示伪造证件，或者贿赂、欺骗客服。",
   "spoken": "常见的手法，是出示伪造证件，或者贿赂、欺骗客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.848,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 10.946,
   "speechEnd": 15.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "号码到手，他在交易所、邮箱、社交账号上，点忘记密码。",
   "spoken": "号码到手，他在交易所、邮箱、社交账号上，点忘记密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.708,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 16.806,
   "speechEnd": 21.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "短信验证码，发到了他的新卡上。",
   "spoken": "短信验证码，发到了他的新卡上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.928,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 23.026,
   "speechEnd": 25.454
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "这一步能成功，是因为账号允许短信验证码，作为唯一的恢复方式。",
   "spoken": "这一步能成功，是因为账号允许短信验证码，作为唯一的恢复方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.508,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 26.606,
   "speechEnd": 31.558
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "再想一种情况，账号开了验证器 App，但忘记密码时，仍然可以用短信。",
   "spoken": "再想一种情况，账号开了验证器 App，但忘记密码时，仍然可以用短信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.608,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 32.706,
   "speechEnd": 38.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "只要短信能单独完成恢复，验证器就被绕过了。",
   "spoken": "只要短信能单独完成恢复，验证器就被绕过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.188,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 39.286,
   "speechEnd": 42.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "第二因素有多强，取决于恢复流程里最弱的一环。",
   "spoken": "第二因素有多强，取决于恢复流程里最弱的一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.92,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 44.018,
   "speechEnd": 47.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "社交账号被劫持，入口不止换卡。",
   "spoken": "社交账号被劫持，入口不止换卡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.7,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 48.798,
   "speechEnd": 51.929
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "还有弱密码被暴力破解，团队交接时，多因素认证被关掉。",
   "spoken": "还有弱密码被暴力破解，团队交接时，多因素认证被关掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 53.0,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 53.098,
   "speechEnd": 57.717
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "冒充平台官方，发版权侵权、账号违规的钓鱼邮件。",
   "spoken": "冒充平台官方，发版权侵权、账号违规的钓鱼邮件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 58.788,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 58.886,
   "speechEnd": 63.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "官方账号发出的链接，粉丝几乎没有理由怀疑。",
   "spoken": "官方账号发出的链接，粉丝几乎没有理由怀疑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.336,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 64.434,
   "speechEnd": 67.922
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2023 年 9 月，Vitalik Buterin 的 X 账号被盗，发出了假的纪念 NFT 链接。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 9 月，Vitalik Buterin 的 X 账号被盗，发出了假的纪念 NFT 链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 68.996,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 69.094,
   "speechEnd": 75.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "粉丝签名后，钱包被清空，ZachXBT 统计，约 69.1 万美元。",
   "spoken": "粉丝签名后，钱包被清空，ZachXBT 统计，约 69.1 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 76.248,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 76.346,
   "speechEnd": 81.715
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，安全公司 Mandiant 的 X 账号，被改名冒充 Phantom 钱包。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，安全公司 Mandiant 的 X 账号，被改名冒充 Phantom 钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 82.78,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 82.878,
   "speechEnd": 88.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "Mandiant 自查认为，很可能是被暴力破解，交接期间，多因素认证没有起到保护。",
   "spoken": "Mandiant 自查认为，很可能是被暴力破解，交接期间，多因素认证没有起到保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 89.432,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 89.53,
   "speechEnd": 95.518
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "后来，有人冒充 X 官方，发版权侵权通知。",
   "spoken": "后来，有人冒充 X 官方，发版权侵权通知。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 96.588,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 96.686,
   "speechEnd": 100.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "接管了 15 个加密类账号，推广假代币，约 50 万美元。",
   "spoken": "接管了 15 个加密类账号，推广假代币，约 50 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 101.656,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 101.754,
   "speechEnd": 106.242
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "交易所的员工也一样。",
   "spoken": "交易所的员工也一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 107.3,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 107.398,
   "speechEnd": 108.731
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "美国联邦起诉书称，一个团伙对一名员工，做了 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "美国联邦起诉书称，一个团伙对一名员工，做了 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.8,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 109.898,
   "speechEnd": 114.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "转走的加密资产，超过 4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "转走的加密资产，超过 4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 115.732,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 115.83,
   "speechEnd": 118.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "媒体援引消息源，确认受害公司是 FTX，时间是它申请破产的当天。",
   "spoken": "媒体援引消息源，确认受害公司是 FTX，时间是它申请破产的档天。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 119.72,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 119.818,
   "speechEnd": 125.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "员工的手机号，就是交易所的特权凭证。",
   "spoken": "员工的手机号，就是交易所的特权凭证。",
